{"id":"b20ef7537d531bd9","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-filter-generated.md","title":"Generated Filter","display":"Generated Filter","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-filter-generated","aliases":["93-lem-filter-generated"],"display":"Generated Filter","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-least-filter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-filter-generated"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-filter-generated</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Generated Filter"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc3b7feadfdbd674\" href=\"?note=bc3b7feadfdbd674\" title=\"93-df-least-filter\">93-df-least-filter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-filter-generated---Generated-Filter\">lem-filter-generated - Generated Filter</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is a lattice candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\neq X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\">\\(\\varnothing\\neq X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> is the lattice class of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fil}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fil}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> are the filter predicate and generated-filter constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bc3b7feadfdbd674\" href=\"?note=bc3b7feadfdbd674\" title=\"93-df-least-filter\">93-df-least-filter</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}filter\\text{-}generated}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\\varnothing\\neq X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n(X\\subseteq F\\to\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\subseteq F)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}filter\\text{-}generated}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\\varnothing\\neq X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n(X\\subseteq F\\to\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\subseteq F)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The nonempty-generator condition prevents the intersection from becoming empty in an unbounded lattice.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-filter-generated---Generated-Filter","text":"lem-filter-generated - Generated Filter","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-least-filter","status":"resolved","id":"bc3b7feadfdbd674","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-least-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf A$ is a lattice candidate and $\\varnothing\\neq X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|$; $\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fil}$ and $\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}$ are the filter predicate and generated-filter constructor of [[93-df-filter]] and [[93-df-least-filter]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-least-filter","status":"resolved","id":"bc3b7feadfdbd674","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fil}$ and $\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}$ are the filter predicate and generated-filter constructor of [[93-df-filter]] and [[93-df-least-filter]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\neq X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fil}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}filter\\text{-}generated}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\\varnothing\\neq X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\\\\n&\\to\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\\\\n&\\hspace{4em}\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n(X\\subseteq F\\to\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\subseteq F)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1206,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["bc3b7feadfdbd674","3b5f38bd115ed203","9beeac4373d773f8"]}